# The exact pins a person edits. `make lock` compiles them, with every transitive package and the sha256 of every wheel, into
# requirements.txt (what the image installs); requirements-tracking.txt adds mlflow. `make lock-check` fails on drift.
# Serving only: the intent model is JSON scored in pure Python (agent/policy/intent_model.py), so no ML or data-frame
# libraries here; they live in requirements-tracking.in with the training and evaluation code that uses them.
# Python 3.11.
